== links single-value n=16384 valuesFor: ordered vs btree-map
A: 92.78 ns per operation (median)
B: 177.2 ns per operation (median)
A needs 46.5% less time than B: B takes 1.87 times as long as A.
With 95% confidence the difference lies between 46.1% and 47.9% less time (B takes between 1.86 and 1.92 times as long as A).
Noise floor: 1.73%. Identical code measured against itself on this setup can look that different, so smaller differences mean nothing.
